{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_12_level_main_12-12_beg","groupId":"main_12","stageId":"main_12-12","title":"捂住耳朵","storyCode":"12-14","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_12-12_beg.txt","sourceHash":"300e76079ee3fc0398d36dd5b415fb52d2d26589e4098ae48ee0c1fb2b16743f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"整合運動、“灰禮帽”、羅德島與深池部隊齊聚諾伯特區，事態進一步混亂。而推進之王的阿斯蘭王室身份和手中的諸王之息，使她成為漩渦的中心。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"灰礼帽”\""},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g4_fogblockadestreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，我想起來了，那是羅德島的制服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Guard先生有一件一樣的，蘇茜小姐離開了卡拉頓之後，好像也去了那個叫羅德島的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們應該是些好人，否則怎麼會幫助蘇茜小姐呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們在這裡，也在幫助那些感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，好人總是倒楣，好人總會為自己選擇太多責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而有的責任，本來就不可能有人擔得起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可憐的羅德島，他們也許從一開始就搞錯了道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像九說的，打針和吃藥解決不了礦石病，身體上的痛苦可能可以緩解，但是別人的眼光卻不可能輕易改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"必須逼迫他們看見我們，逼迫他們聽見我們的聲音，逼迫他們承認我們不是膿瘡與潰瘍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們覺得呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們跟著我夠久了，朋友們，關於我剛才的話，幾位有什麼高見嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"整合運動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？ (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你不在我們的任務目標中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我猜，我們可以繼續各走各的路？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真的走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然深池來了，我也該帶著他們撤離了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘖，要是時間再多點，還能多說服點人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_328_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，去接上她吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g6_hotellobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自稱是個詩人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊內絲小姐，你又有何高見？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我見過些其他詩人，他們比你強得多，因為——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們從不濫用比喻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塵埃，砂紙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座地塊，這個國家裡，乃至這片大地上，誰是塵埃，誰是砂紙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又有什麼資格，決定誰是塵埃，誰是砂紙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰爭不配用任何比喻修飾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它不是了不起的征途，不是重鑄榮光的爐火，不是駛向復興的航船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它只是泥水裡掙扎的人，廢墟裡被炸斷的手臂，永遠無法散去的臭味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它只是這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我再熟悉不過，它只是這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可以保留彼此的意見，我尊重一位資深雇傭兵的看法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但關於是否從棋子成為朋友的提議，我需要一個結論。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"伊內絲。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"戴菲恩的回答是什麼？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她答應了，只要我們和她都能活著離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她已經前往通訊站，廣播很快就能發出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，我們不必走到這一步的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你拒絕了維多利亞的邀請。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"開斯特公爵還不能代表維多利亞。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她會代表的。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是個明智的決定。"}]},{"label":"我只是拒絕了一位蹩腳的詩人。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伶牙俐齒幫不了你，羅德島的博士。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是你們的小伎倆嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩？你怎麼在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀茜瓦爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_864_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快走！他們——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡真是熱鬧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我該稱你為赤鐵近衛隊的隊長，還是深池的“校官”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來是你們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g5_blockadewall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這日子終於快到頭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴菲恩和那位博士會搞定那個通訊站的，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一切都會順利，我們可以離開諾伯特區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你之後打算去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能在諾伯特區混幫派的人，要不就是從孤兒院出來的，要不就是早就沒了可投靠的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜，我們也都差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總有辦法的，總能找到吃飯的辦法。哈，說不定我會跑去加入那些傳說中的“鏽錘”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正我不會去什麼大公爵的領地當難民，跪在地上求那些鼻孔朝天的人賞我碗飯吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡鐸爾——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，你覺得我還在說像當初“揍翻薩卡茲”那樣天真的蠢話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......貝爾德，我在這些日子裡丟掉的東西已經夠多了。我不能把最後一點點堅持都放棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些......痛苦，這些折磨，如果最後只讓我依然成了個被它們壓垮的懦夫，我寧願現在就死在巷子裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許......被壓垮也沒什麼好指摘的，卡鐸爾。沒有人真的有副鐵鑄的脊樑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白天，我去了趟影廳，當時麥克拉倫沒去搶那輛裝滿補給品的行李車，我還以為他出了什麼事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他以前就是個疑神疑鬼的怪人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以前也沒少喝他那些兌水飲料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，祝他長命百歲。他還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他還活著嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"影廳的外面很淒慘。我猜，他被襲擊了不少次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我試著叫他的名字，但沒有回應。我原本以為他躲去了別的地方，直到......我在被釘死的窗戶縫隙間，看到了他那雙眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凸出眼眶，充滿血絲，恐懼，絕望。我不敢看第二眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許他走不出他的影廳了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都清楚......我們離他們，離你口中的那些“懦夫”，也沒那麼遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還有挽救這一切的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這很難，我們要活過薩卡茲可能的反撲，再撐過大公爵軍隊的炮火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但並非不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我們必須摸清薩卡茲駐軍在這裡的動向......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，陛下總會及時激勵我們，提醒我們需要做什麼，真是可靠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡鐸爾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您又有什麼指示？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想......你覺得，國王是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，想把我也納入你的封臣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我說過很多次，我只是格拉斯哥幫的維娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是發現，我從沒認真想過這個問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也許並不明白，除了那些有關榮耀與威嚴的禮讚詞之外，國王對於你們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，對於我們，是一種什麼樣的存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼都不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們和我沒有一點關係，我更願意把我的敬意交給在我口袋裡錢不夠時給我打折的小吃店老闆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自古以來，維多利亞都有一位國王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？他們是誰？真是抱歉，我可不是什麼尊貴的阿斯蘭或者德拉克，我沒見過其中任何一位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是只是活在報紙上的幾個名字，那我對廣告上那位敘拉古餐廳的維托大廚還更熟悉些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已經多少年沒有一位國王了，我們的日子過得更糟了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，或許是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我很懷疑，這一切與是否擁有一位國王沒那麼大關聯。不論是你，還是別的什麼大人物登上了王座，你們還是不會正眼看我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你們的定義裡，可能一位昏庸的王會沉迷於宴會和美酒，一位賢明的王會盤算著戰爭與稅收。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我說，都是自我滿足，都是自以為能統御一切的虛榮心罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"推進之王，你被諾伯特區的這些人當做唯一的希望頂禮膜拜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，你享受嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得拯救他們是你該死的光榮使命嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我從不說“使命”，從不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，你覺得你負有某種責任，去回應這些目光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是一碼事，可憐的陛下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自己清楚，這些目光之所以願意投向你，到底是因為你是個街頭幫派的一員......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是因為你的那個了不起的姓氏，“維多利亞”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說老實話，我同樣希望有個人能拯救這一切，拯救所有人，拯救這個該死的看不到頭的糞坑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰做得到？別做夢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勇於承擔責任是個能幫我們在街頭混下去的良好品德，推進之王。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，別以“國王”的姿態給人虛假的希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也別......真以為自己天生就該被這麼期待。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，要幹掉他嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別起衝突，不要打草驚蛇，我們現在只是要摸清他們的佈置......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有些不對勁，提高警惕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別誤會，先生，我們不是來找麻煩的，我們只是路過......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"貝爾德！你不是說不要打草驚蛇嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝爾德","speakerId":"avg_npc_863_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，我什麼都沒幹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些血......他之前就重傷了，他是逃到這裡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是封鎖區裡的人動的手嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不應該，我們不是沒有嘗試過，幹掉一兩個或許有機會，但把我們關在這裡的可是一支軍隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡鐸爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_862_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是一次偷襲成功，他們也能馬上反應過來，除非......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這附近......平常有這麼安靜嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"封鎖區的高牆上，探照燈如往日一樣灑下慘白的光。\n他們已經熟悉了諾伯特區的臭味，但這裡，彌漫著一絲新鮮的血腥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......離開這裡，快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須馬上把這片地塊上還能找到的市民集中在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"達格達","speakerId":"avg_npc_396_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，伊內絲小姐和博士還沒有傳來訊息......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們只能假定他們行動順利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推進之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人已經在行動了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你確定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"我確定，那是個阿斯蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵 (A)","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"這個人不在我們的目標裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵 (B)","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，她會親自做判斷的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"37_g6_hotellobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該死，這裡的門被封上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，站在我的身後。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，歡迎來到日落街酒店，這裡已經很久沒有這麼多大人物光顧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀茜瓦爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_864_1","isRemote":false,"text":"考伯特！我不是叫你藏好嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有客人上門卻不招待，這可是酒店經理的失職。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是抱歉，如今眼下的條件有限，要不然，我該給各位端上待客的茶水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問，有什麼可以幫助各位的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴菲恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_866_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那有普通的水嗎？我確實......有些渴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這我倒是能為您效力，戴菲恩小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老威靈頓果然不捨得放過這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開斯特公爵也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們願意放我離開嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和那位藍色頭髮的菲林都不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，開斯特公爵與威靈頓公爵，在對抗薩卡茲方面還是有一些默契的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對我們各自的目標......也有一些默契。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只服從我接受的命令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔拉人都和你一樣死板嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“校官”","speakerId":"avg_npc_723_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的幽默感只會留給我的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，我很喜歡交朋友，同為維多利亞人，不如從抱怨天氣開始怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，天氣......倫蒂尼姆的天氣總是那麼糟，越來越糟啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要放在四十年前，出太陽的日子還要多些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候，這家酒店的情況也要好得多。多了不起的酒店啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到今天，我還記得自己剛來應聘門童的時候呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說，那時候連公爵都喜歡住在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰禮帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡沒你的事，薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，真是抱歉，我更希望你把我看作一個和你一樣的維多利亞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都是維多利亞的子民，我們可以不用那麼緊張，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個自認維多利亞人的薩卡茲可不多見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，你的情況難道不是和我差不多嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這些生活在卡茲戴爾之外的薩卡茲，也總得給自己找一個家吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊內絲","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕大部分薩卡茲不這麼認為。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以他們才總是那麼失望，總是那麼疲憊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要我看，我在這裡活了一輩子，這裡的每一堵牆，每一片地板我都很熟悉，比起遙遠的卡茲戴爾要熟悉多啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原諒我這些天的懶惰，放在以前，每一張桌子我都會親自擦拭得一塵不染。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我為我的工作自豪，你們真該看看它以前的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些時光......總能給我一些錯覺，日子會一直這麼持續下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，那些時光終究是結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珀茜瓦爾，真可惜，你入職的時候，這家酒店已經敗落了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀茜瓦爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_864_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......說實話，我沒那麼在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果它像現在一樣受戰火摧殘，轟然倒塌，說實話，我可能還更好受些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我難過的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個和過往的日子沒什麼不同的下午，我擦完桌子，抬起頭——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"猛然發現，我身邊的一切竟然這麼陳舊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"考伯特","speakerId":"avg_npc_865_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我甚至不知道，這些事情是怎麼發生的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
